                ("Breaker Current Rating", f"{site.acdb_current_a} Amps"),
                ("Rated Inverter Operating Current", f"{site.acdb_rated_current_a:.2f} Amps"),
                ("Trip Curve & Breaking Capacity", "Type C Curve / 10 kA Breaking Capacity (IS/IEC 60898-1)"),
